SUMMARY:Life is a Gift that You Can Receive Regardless of What Others Do
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nYou really do crea
 te your own reality! What that fully means and how to use it well are the 
 biggest challenges facing humanity today. But the evidence is clear. Peopl
 e can have radically different life experiences even with similar backgrou
 nds and current conditions. A little positive thinking can go a long way\,
  even to the point of the placebo effect which must be factored into media
 l studies. Oops\, this person got better just because they expected to fro
 m a fake pill! The open secret is that the Universe is alive and it loves 
 you\, so the default of life is endless gifts that you’re free to receiv
 e. The only price you must pay is to become more of your real true happy s
 elf every day\, regardless of what others may say or do. You must value yo
 ur own unique purpose and joy more than fitting in with a negative society
  that threatens you to conform or die. Sound scary? Don’t worry\, when y
 ou see how the false negative systems work then they can’t affect you. T
 hey are false and negative\, while you are positive and powerful.\n\nJoin 
 us Sunday July 12\, 2026 for a free empowering talk on how to hold your ow
 n positive energy in a world full of distractions and temptations to be mi
 serable. The key is to keep rising and reframing to reach the higher views
  of self-love. You don’t have to understand other people’s problems\, 
 much less solve them. They can fix their own life just like you can fix yo
 urs\, so you don’t need the false beliefs that say you’re selfish for 
 being happy when others are not. Success breeds success and joy inspires m
 ore joy. If you’re inspired to help make the world a better place\, then
  you actually have a duty to live the happiest life that you can\, so othe
 rs can see what they can do too.\n\nTruly negative people are actively exp
 loiting people’s suffering\, so all you need do to be positive is hold k
 ind caring compassionate boundaries to intend no harm. You’re not selfis
 h for wanting to focus on your own life\, because your life will include h
 elping others when the Spirit of all life guides you to assist easily. Peo
 ple who overexert and self-sacrifice to help others aren’t helping as mu
 ch as they think\, because they’re really teaching the examples of guilt
 \, sacrifice\, and shame for not being able to do more to fix the whole wo
 rld. But the world isn’t broken\, only not being applied. A thriving Uni
 verse that already works is just waiting to be discovered when we do our o
 wn little best and let Source do the rest. Life is a quality not a quantit
 y experience this way. The patterns you set by your own actions become ref
 lected around you by the so-called law of attraction. This is really just 
 the power of cooperation\, as the smallest act of harmonious love is infin
 itely more effective than the biggest actions of chaotic hate. The Univers
 e is a wonderful song that’s calling you to sing along in your own speci
 al voice.\n\nSo much of what people do today is defensive\, because the do
 mination culture constantly reinforces the false negative belief that what
  others do must affect you. Many people are scared of becoming too happy a
 nd successful because then they’ll be a target for the criticism\, jealo
 usy\, and blame of others. Bitterness and revenge are not how life really 
 work\, but negative human society makes the bad examples to scare you into
  conformity. Well\, it’s time to opt out. How? By seeing the obedience s
 ystem for what it is\, a way to keep herding unhappy people until they dec
 ide to love themselves more. You’ve been indoctrinated with layers of fa
 lse beliefs that you can peel back like the onion that makes you cry. Let 
 your emotions out so the core joy of your own gift of life can surface mor
 e every day.\n\nFor this meetup\, imagine that the Universe has all the gi
 fts you’ll ever need to be happy and healthy forever. Of course it does\
 , because you’re a part of it and it wants to be happy and healthy forev
 er with you. So as you picture yourself having the perfect life\, what fea
 rs and reasons why not come to mind? Will you lose your false friends\, wi
 ll you lose your bad habits\, will you forgive your mistakes and be good e
 nough? We’ll look at how reality creation really works\, which is so eas
 ily and naturally that understanding and releasing your own blockages is t
 he only real trick to learn. With more spiritual creator awareness\, you
 ’ll appreciate your own unique path in life and receive it as what keeps
  you actually safe. We’ll conclude with a guided meditation to work more
  closely with the higher self to unleash and enjoy your destined potential
 s to live happily ever after.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritu
 al support group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the las
 t 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can’t stay you can get the 
 recording. You can signup here for this meeting and visit www.signupISM.co
 m for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl 
 Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nq
 uick-links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.com)
